\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The intelligence ladder. Each rung is admitted only above the certifiable rungs beneath it, and each rung carries its measured marginal effect (\S  \ref {sec:evaluation}). The dashed arrow is the result RQ4 adds: the assessed kind-awareness rung descended to the deterministic floor -- no effect the benchmark resolves, no regression risk, no provider dependency. Descending is the load-bearing direction; a rung that cannot show a measurable benefit above the rung below it does not stay on the ladder.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:ladder}{{1}{5}{The intelligence ladder. Each rung is admitted only above the certifiable rungs beneath it, and each rung carries its measured marginal effect (\S \ref {sec:evaluation}). The dashed arrow is the result RQ4 adds: the assessed kind-awareness rung descended to the deterministic floor -- no effect the benchmark resolves, no regression risk, no provider dependency. Descending is the load-bearing direction; a rung that cannot show a measurable benefit above the rung below it does not stay on the ladder}{figure.1}{}}
\@writefile{toc}{\contentsline {subsection}{\numberline {3.2}The Fiction Graph}{5}{subsection.3.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{sec:graph}{{3.2}{5}{The Fiction Graph}{subsection.3.2}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The verified deception loop. A session enters through the behavioral classifier (Chrollo), which routes it to a per-class deception policy. The retrieval engine (Don) grounds the policy in CTI; the fiction graph binds every host fact; the generator drafts under the binding; the verifier checks the draft against the graph before serving. Dashed paths are failure paths: verification failure falls back to deterministic transcripts, and content flagged \textsc  {require} pauses at the human-in-the-loop gate.}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{2}{6}{The verified deception loop. A session enters through the behavioral classifier (Chrollo), which routes it to a per-class deception policy. The retrieval engine (Don) grounds the policy in CTI; the fiction graph binds every host fact; the generator drafts under the binding; the verifier checks the draft against the graph before serving. Dashed paths are failure paths: verification failure falls back to deterministic transcripts, and content flagged \textsc {require} pauses at the human-in-the-loop gate}{figure.2}{}}
